    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents habitat domain information for animals in the landscape. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_habitat_domain_source" kindref="compound">HabitatDomainSource</ref> extends <ref refid="class_path_source" kindref="compound">PathSource</ref> and contains data on which habitat cells are suitable for each species and life stage. It can provide a status map and a textual description of the source. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
